  m_text: 'HIDDEN ROLE (working title): an original hidden-role game for Altspace.

    Rules
    translated from MIT-licensed C#: Copyright (c) 2026 chocowriter; gameplay code
    by dmjdesu (MIT licence). The station is generated from that project''s map data;
    every name, word and look here is this port''s own.

    Port and runtime (portkit):
    MIT. Source: github.com/sidequestlegend/hidden-role-altspace

    Station models,
    textures and tones: made for this port from formulas, no outside files.

    Text:
    Liberation Sans, digitized data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation, copyright
    (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc. (SIL Open Font License 1.1).

    No voice isolation exists
    here: while a match runs, the downed and onlookers are kept in a bunkroom 70
    m below, beyond the 50 m a voice can carry.

    Click to close.'
